petal-elements is a modified version of Material Web, starting from upstream
commit 47adb655bd7a88c4d62e8faac2873084eed555dc (2026-10-07). The full
upstream history is kept in this repository.

Modifications (details in the git history):
- Custom element tags renamed from md-* to petal-*, element classes from Md* to
  Petal*, and the package from @material/web to petal-elements. This is done by
  scripts/rebrand.ts and re-applied after each upstream merge.
- Build steps rewritten as Node scripts so the build runs on Windows
  (scripts/build-tasks.ts).
- Package metadata, README, contributing, security, issue template and CI files
  replaced or edited for this project.
- Google Sans font files and two documentation images with third-party content
  removed (see docs/licensing.md).

Source files changed from upstream keep their original copyright and license
header and carry the line "Modified for petal-elements" where the file format
allows comments.

The Material Design web tokens in tokens/versions/ are part of Material Web.
Files generated from them (tokens/dtcg/web/, tokens/css/) state their source
commit and Google's copyright in their headers.

